#: ../../source/iot_project_esp01/01-iot_Flame_alert_system.rst:19
msgid "Flame Alert System with Blynk"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_esp01/01-iot_Flame_alert_system.rst:28
msgid "In this chapter, we will guide you through the process of creating a home flame alarm system demo using Blynk. By utilizing a flame sensor, you can detect potential fires in your home. Sending the detected values to Blynk allows for remote monitoring of your home via the internet. In case of a fire, Blynk will promptly notify you via email."
msgstr ""

